70/extras/bb2103c40180d75c7505ac3924652a66.mp4?t=1742634632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapters in Part 1</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 1</strong>: Connecting the dots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Chapter 2</strong>: Breath of fresh air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Chapter 3</strong>: Back to square one. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes in Part 1</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong> - classic game run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torture</strong> - replay Chapter 3 with a more challenging puzzle (unlocked once Standard mode is completed).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun</strong> - replay the game with a timer, no cut scenes (unlocked once Standard mode is completed).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809570/extras/050f9d1f3905ad40af8cd3f658aa43d6.avif?t=1742634632\" data-has-big width=800 height=484 /></span></p>",
